<title>USA: Technology Solutions to buy HRM Resources.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions to buy HRM Resources.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Solutions Co said Tuesday it will acquire HRM Resources Inc, a technology consulting firm, in a deal valued at $12.5 million.</p>
<p>Technology Solutions said the deal will enhance its client/server expertise and broaden its enterprise applications consulting capabilities. HRM Resources specializes in developing large-scale financial and human resources software packages, the company said.</p>
<p>Technology Solutions provides business and technology consulting services.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 15/16 Tuesday at 35-3/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
